`@did-plc/server` and `@did-plc/lib` are consumed as unmodified npm
dependencies. No upstream source is redistributed in this repository.

`sqlite-db.js` is an original implementation of the `PlcDatabase` interface
that `@did-plc/server` accepts. Its control flow — validate the proposed
operation, hash it, insert, nullify superseded operations, assert the prev
match — follows the upstream Postgres store at `@did-plc/server@0.0.1`
(`dist/db/index.js`) and is derived from reading it.
